>na</span></p><p begin="2:44.345" end="2:45.829" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.345" end="2:44.713">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:44.713" end="2:44.920">beau</span><span begin="2:44.920" end="2:45.178">ti</span><span begin="2:45.178" end="2:45.829">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是这么美</span></p><p begin="2:47.293" end="2:48.643" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.293" end="2:47.597">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:47.597" end="2:47.812">beau</span><span begin="2:47.812" end="2:48.043">ti</span><span begin="2:48.043" end="2:48.643">ful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是这么美</span></p><p begin="2:50.200" end="2:53.022" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.200" end="2:50.513">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:50.513" end="2:50.707">beau</span><span begin="2:50.707" end="2:50.957">ti</span><span begin="2:50.957" end="2:51.643">ful,</span> <span begin="2:51.643" end="2:52.313">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:52.313" end="2:53.022">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是这么美 这千真万确</span></p><p begin="2:55.282" end="3:00.406" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.282" end="2:55.585">There</span> <span begin="2:55.585" end="2:56.116">must</span> <span begin="2:56.116" end="2:56.675">be</span> <span begin="2:56.675" end="2:56.746">an</span> <span begin="2:56.746" end="2:57.756">angel</span> <span begin="2:58.241" end="2:58.342">with</span> <span begin="2:58.342" end="2:58.567">a</span> <span begin="2:58.567" end="2:58.975">smile</span> <span begin="2:58.975" end="2:59.290">on</span> <span begin="2:59.290" end="2:59.678">her</span> <span begin="2:59.678" end="3:00.406">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看到了笑起来跟她一模一样的天使</span></p><p begin="3:02.616" end="3:05.039" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.616" end="3:02.756">When</span> <span begin="3:02.756" end="3:02.981">she</span> <span begin="3:02.981" end="3:03.251">thought</span> <span begin="3:03.251" end="3:03.443">up</span> <span begin="3:03.443" end="3:03.557">that</span> <span begin="3:03.557" end="3:03.807">I</span> <span begin="3:03.807" end="3:04.097">should</span> <span begin="3:04.097" end="3:04.319">be</span> <span begin="3:04.319" end="3:04.505">with</span> <span begin="3:04.505" end="3:05.039">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当她也想到我们应该在一起时</span></p><p begin="3:12.572" end="3:16.504" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.572" end="3:12.740">But</span> <span begin="3:12.740" end="3:13.064">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:13.064" end="3:13.609">time</span> <span begin="3:13.609" end="3:14.324">to</span> <span begin="3:14.324" end="3:15.085">face</span> <span begin="3:15.085" end="3:15.752">the</span> <span begin="3:15.752" end="3:16.504">truth</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但该是面对事实的时候了</span></p><p begin="3:18.335" end="3:22.323" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:18.335" end="3:18.581">I</span> <span begin="3:18.581" end="3:18.917">will</span> <span begin="3:18.917" end="3:19.490">ne</span><span begin="3:19.490" end="3:20.198">ver</span> <span begin="3:20.198" end="3:20.942">be</span> <span begin="3:20.942" end="3:21.641">with</span> <span begin="3:21.641" end="3:22.323">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我和你永远无法相依</span></p></div></body></tt>